### Negative-findings notes

- Four independent checks, all negative (2026-10-19): (1) Bing web search for
  the exact slug + MAI model terms returned zero relevant results; (2) a full
  sweep of the models.dev multi-provider catalog found no
  `mai-experimental-test` under any provider (only unrelated MAI Voice/Image/
  Transcribe/Code SKUs); (3) the OpenCode Zen documentation endpoints and
  pricing tables list no such route; (4) the live OpenCode inference roster
  does not list it.
- The name pattern (`-experimental-test`) is consistent with a throwaway
  evaluation endpoint rather than a productized model; even if it exists
  privately, zero public benchmark numbers are available, so scoring is
  impossible without fabrication.
- If Microsoft (or any publisher) ever surfaces this route publicly with a
  model card and harness numbers, a new signed file should supersede these
  notes.

